ator/guide.  \n\n- **Demonstrated Ability:** **Clairvoyance (scrying).**  \n\n- **Key Visual Cues:**  \n  1. **Orb extraction:** In Frames\u202f0350‑0354 the man pulls the glowing orb from a calabash‑shaped vessel.  \n  2. **Focused gaze:** Throughout Frames\u202f0355‑0361 he stares intently at the orb, holding it steady in his palm.  \n  3. **Orb illumination:** Frame\u202f0362 shows the orb pulsing from blue to purple‑pink, a classic magic‑vision effect.  \n  4. **Scene shift:** Frames\u202f0364‑0365 abruptly cut to a dark, icy cavern, implying the man is “seeing” that distant location through the orb.  \n\n- **Conclusion:** The elderly man uses the blue orb to look into another place, confirming the skill being displayed is clairvoyance rather than any of the other listed powers (clairaudience, invisibility, indestructibility).', 'failed_images': []}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "CAPTION_SEARCH",\n    "search_queries": [\n        "blue calabash brother with blue clothing using special power",\n        "blue gourd boy demonstrating supernatural ability",\n        "calabash brother in blue vest activating power",\n        "blue warrior with green leaf necklace using magic"\n    ]\n}'}, {'role': 'caption search results', 'content': 'Retrieved frames from 4 different search queries.\n\nReview all results below and choose the most relevant frames for your question.\n\n\n--- Query 1: "blue calabash brother with blue clothing using special power" ---\n[\n  {\n    "frames/frame_1867": "frames/frame_1867",\n    "text": "A cartoon character is wearing a light blue robe with dark blue trim and a blue leafy design, and has two yellow objects hanging from it.",\n    "similarity score": 0.6516926288604736\n  },\n  {\n    "frames/frame_2089": "frames/frame_2089",\n    "text": "A cartoon character is being pulled up by a person wearing a blue shirt and dark blue pants with a yellow cuff, in a scene set against a light blue background.",\n    "similarity sco